  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41123" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the productive capacity of micro, small and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs) for better integration into strategic sector value chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to improve the productivity and competitiveness of Colombian MSMEs for better integration into the value chains of sectors prioritized in the National Reindustrialization Policy. This will be achieved through technical assistance for MSMEs to identify and strengthen the productive and strategic aspects needed to participate in the value chains; an academic agenda to improve their hard and soft skills; and the support of B2B meetings to consolidate the demand for products and services and present business opportunities. Outcome 1. Improved compliance and productive capacities of MSMEs to comply with technical requirements and integrate better into the value chains of the prioritized sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
